---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About | Airport Runways Live"
  description="Airport Runways Live is a directory of airport livestreams and a hosted channel covering Orlando International and Tampa International."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>Airport Runways Live</h1>
      <p>Airport Runways Live is a directory of airport livestreams and a hosted plane-spotting channel.</p>
      <p>
        We host livestreams from Orlando International Airport (MCO) and Tampa International Airport (TPA).
        MCO spotting is done with Greater Orlando Aviation Authority approval. We also cover Bogotá (BOG) when we stream from El Dorado.
      </p>
      <p>
        This website lists other creators’ official YouTube lives. We do not rebroadcast their video. Watch on their
        channel so they keep the views and the Super Chats. Channel owners can
        {' '}<a href="/remove">request removal</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        Not affiliated with GOAA, MCO, TPA, El Dorado, any airline, YouTube, Flightradar24, or CamStreamer.
      </p>
      <p>English and Spanish speakers are welcome in our chat.</p>
      <p>
        Official MCO spotting:{' '}
        <a href="https://flymco.com/non-travelers/planespotting/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          flymco.com/non-travelers/planespotting/
        </a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
